        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-CLW7002ACHSBR, Square Clearwater Glass Shower Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe beautiful 2 Inch Square Clearwater Shower Knob Set is perfect for your bathroom with its classy, modern design. It is made from hand chiseled acrylic. The Square Clearwater Shower Knob Pair comes packaged with 2 knobs and a mounting kit for a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLW07-specifications.gif?v=1704354552\" width=\"451\" height=\"249\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions SD-CLW7002ACHSBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available as a <a href=\"/products/2-inch-diameter-clearwater-shower-knob-set-first-impressions-sd-clw6002achsbr\"><b>2\" Round Clearwater Shower Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions SD-CLW7002ACHSBR Clearwater Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Hand Chiseled Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Knob Thickness: .67\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.92\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLW07-specifications.pdf?v=1704262333\"><b>First Impressions SD-CLW7002ACHSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door knob is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls and mounting hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
