                "title": "2 Inch Square Clearwater Shower Knob Set",
                "description": "The beautiful 2 Inch Square Clearwater Shower Knob Set is perfect for your bathroom with its classy, modern design. It is made from hand chiseled acrylic. The Square Clearwater Shower Knob Pair comes packaged with 2 knobs and a mounting kit for a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass door.",
